 "content_notes": "Tone: absurd and ironic; the joke is on the hiding places, never on the animals. Lizards and ants are stylised, alive and unharmed (the one lizard reported dead is neither drawn nor narrated). The Haneda traveller and the eight Delhi passengers are accused only: never named; the traveller is a faceless silhouette tagged NOT A LIKENESS and the passengers are not drawn. The Nairobi man (pleaded guilty, sentenced) is a faceless silhouette, never named. Officers are generic figures with no badge, patch, flag, crest or agency logo; no weapon. The aircraft cabin and the airports are generic, with no airline livery or logo; airlines and airports are named only in plain text. Every card is our own typed graphic. No dialogue or quotation. Facts verified 2026-10-18.",
